Nicholas,

Please find the Japan Finance desk instructions attached for Components and P=
ackaging. We can start at 07 on 18 August, provided the primary and deputy co=
ver and authority are confirmed on the 15th. Please ask Siobhan to check that=
 both desks can receive and act on the files, including the Packaging deputy.

The change to the 09 hand-off is separate. We will check access to the approv=
al and exception evidence on 22 August before deciding whether to proceed. Un=
til then the current 09 route remains in place; Treasury's two checks remain =
in place throughout.

Kenneth

